UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'There are SO MANY benefits to promoting genre playlists over singles ✨ and don’t get me wrong, waterfall release is still the way to go, but I highly recommend promoting playlists for most artists under 500k monthly listeners. Auxiliary benefits: 1. Associates your music with the right artists 2. Lifts up the whole scene 3. You can monetize the playlist if you want 4. You own and can control the playlist and where your songs are on it 5. You can promote whatever song you want — new or old — and all your songs on the playlist still benefit 6. You can order the songs strategically for listener retention and popularity scores across your catalog 7. People LOVE playlists The key here is making sure you set up your campaigns correctly. Don’t blow your stack on bad ads or traffic campaigns — USE A LANDING PAGE WITH A PIXEL ON IT and optimize for website conversions!!!' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7511081006011567390';
