UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Phrases that make you instantly more persuasive—and trusted. Follow me @yasarahmad_ for more. Comment ''WORKING'' and I’ll DM you my full Win at Work Playbook—scripts, strategies, and real-world language to grow your influence fast. Free tools + newsletter in bio. If people don’t trust you—they won’t follow you. And shouting louder won’t help. 🧠 You don’t need more volume. You need sharper language. Here are 4 persuasive phrases that shift how people hear you: ✅ “Here’s what I’m seeing—and what I’m still figuring out.” (Sounds honest. Builds trust. Shows confidence + humility.) ✅ “What would make this feel like a win for you?” (Turns tension into partnership. That’s leadership.) ✅ “To be transparent…” (Instant credibility. Their guard drops. You become the voice they trust.) ✅ “Here’s what we can do right now—and what we’ll reassess later.” (Clear, calm direction = influence. Fast.) 🧠 Persuasion isn’t manipulation. It’s alignment. And trust? It’s the most powerful currency in any room. #leadershiplanguage #persuasiontactics #executivepresence #influenceatwork #trustbuilder #careertips #winatwork #CareerAdvice #CareerGrowth #WorkTips #CorporateLife #personaldevelopment #professionaldevelopment #GrowthMindset #WorkLifeBalance #CareerGoals #SkillsToSucceed #SuccessTips #CareerSuccess #SelfImprovement #creatorsearchinsights #LearnOnTikTok #TikTokTips #EduTok #TrendingNow #FYP #ForYou #ForYouPage #creatorsearchinsights Information use only, not professional advice.' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7507307642210094369';
