UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'SHARE this if you’re navigating the messy shift from parenting a child to parenting a teen. You’re not failing—you’re being asked to grow. Here’s what no one tells you: Your parenting needs to change when adolescence begins. Not because your teen is broken—but because their brain is wired for independence, pushback, and identity formation. If you keep parenting them like they’re still 10— You’ll lose influence. You’ll lose connection. And you’ll end up in constant power struggles. So what does it look like to actually shift? 	•	You stop trying to control their behavior—and start holding boundaries that reflect reality. 	•	You stop lecturing—and start validating their inner world, even when you disagree. 	•	You stop managing—and start modeling how to regulate emotion, repair conflict, and take accountability. Validation + boundaries = influence. Not control. Not compliance. Influence. It’s not easy. But it works. Follow me to learn how to grow with your teen instead of fighting against them. No fear. No shame. Just the truth. #parentingteens #gentleparentingteens #parentingadvice #adolescence #parentinggrowth #parentingcoach #teenconnection #boundarieswithteens #respectfulparenting #parentingrealtalk #emotionallyintelligentparenting #fyp #foryoupage' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7503606191465991454';
