UPDATE public.stories SET title = '✉️ What if your email signature could close deals for you? We all know the usual email signature—name, title, maybe a phone number. But here’s a pro tip from marketing expert Dean Jackson: Write a super signature that drives action without being pushy. Imagine ending every email with: "Whenever you''re ready, here are four ways I can help you." Here’s how to create your own super signature: Step 1: List 3-4 actionable ways your audience can engage with you. (e.g., Join my free group, download this PDF, take a course, or schedule a 1-on-1). 📥 Step 2: Keep it light—mention there’s no pressure to buy anything. 🚫💰 Step 3: Add it to every email you send, below your usual signature. This approach makes it easy for your audience to take the next step without feeling sold to. It’s a subtle yet powerful way to deliver value while quietly moving them closer to working with you. ✨ Next time, think beyond the basic signature. Use a super signature to let your audience know exactly how you can help—without hard selling.' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7428376242153475371';
UPDATE public.stories SET title = '3 stages to all relationships, I just talked about the 2nd stage. Stage 1 is the honeymoon stage, nothing more to say here, it’s infatuation and it’s not real.  Stage 3, however, is what’s called spiritual partnership. This is when both people mature enough and heal enough to see the relationship for what it is, a sometimes difficilt but incredible place for massive growth, healing, and expansion. And not about filling in the emptiness inside that was created from childhood. To get to stage 3, it requires doing massive amounts of work, facing your deepest fears and pains. It is also not avoidable, you have to do this or be doomed to repeating your relationship cycles over and over again.  👉🏼If this healing journey is something that you want to join me on, visit my profile link for details 🙏🏼 ##relationships##anxiousattachment##avoidantattachment##healingjourney##codependency##divorce##breakup' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7411910164867042602';
