UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Ad Cheat Codes Below ⬇️ Also grab my top ads google sheet in my bio 🖇️ 1.)Use sound to your advantage. There’s a reason why people love ASMR. My all time best ad had very loud sounds of clothing bags being ruffled during an unboxing.  2.)If you see a trend on organic social, try and re create it as an ad. In 2022 people were re posting screenshots from twitter on instagram. So what did my team do? We created a twitter post style ad template and it absolutely crushed it.  3.)Hack watch time by aligning video cuts to the beat of your background music.  Screen record your phone as you scroll your product reviews and use that as an ad hook.  4.)Try incorporating a toilet. That’s all I’ll say about that.  5.)Always start creative testing with what is known to work from other brands. Then iterate. Originality is very expensive and requires a ton of testing budget.  6.)Try creative video transitions that shock the viewer. Visual illusions are great for this. Follow creators like Zach King for inspiration.  7.)Use face filters on your Ugc ads. Use filters like Age, Animal, Makeup  8.)When you find a winning ad creative think of it as a tree with a complex root system. Each offshoot should be a slight iteration. If you’re struggling with what to iterate, here are some ideas New text overlays  New video thumbnails  New voice over  New script  Recreate the same video with new people Use the existing body with a new hook  Slice up the video to rearrange it Take the Core Image or video and throw it into a new ad template/style  Change the filter or video lense  Keep same hook with a different body (everything after the hook and before the CTA) Watch my 10 minute ads guide  @Caleb | Ads | Ai | Automation  #ugc #facebookads #metaads #tiktokads #mediabuying #mediabuyer #adstyles ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7345624449074367786';
