UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'PSA - watch this if you want to have any hope of growing a business that aligns with what you actually want from your life, can generate sales and is scalable.  This is the framework of steps you need to take if you want to start a business or a side hustle. Don’t be tempted to skip to the end… it’s a process and unless you go through it all ultimately your business will have some serious issues!  1. What you like, what you are good at and what will make you money  2. Be clear on your personal goal  3. Understand how the money works  4. Find product market fit (vitamin/pill) how do you solve a problem?  5. Who is the customer (it’s the people with the problem you solve not the demographic data that you think)  6. How will you reach them? - marketing  7. How will the operations work? Supply chain etc.  8. How does it scale?  9. Where do you fit in?  10. Now you can start to think about brand, sales, storytelling etc.  #startabusiness #sidehustle #sidehustleideas #businessideas #biztok #entrepreneurship #makemoneyonline ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7268705015328492832';
